; +-----------------------------------------+
; Nyao Straddle v1.6 - DEFAULT PROFILE (nyao_straddle.mq5)
; © Copyright Nyao Scalper by Elriz Wiraswara
; +-----------------------------------------+
; Volatility breakout straddle for gold (= the EA's built-in input defaults). Attach it to an
; XAUUSD M1 chart. EXPERIMENTAL - backtested on one year of real ticks; demo forward-test first.
; Rules:
;   Extreme markets only: H1 ATR(14) of closed bars >= $34 (gold's most extreme 10% of 2026)
;           AND the last 7 minutes' ATR >= 2x its average over the last 288 minutes.
;   Entry : a buy stop $1 above and a sell stop $1 below the price; the first fill cancels the other.
;   Exit  : $1 stop, trailing $1 behind the price from the fill (no take profit).
;   Again : a new pair goes out as soon as the position closes, while the market stays extreme.
;   Pause : after 10 losing trades in a row, no new orders for 30 minutes.
;   Lot   : fixed 0.01 (about $1 at the stop, plus slippage).
; Backtest v1.5 (v1.6 only adds the dashboard), Jan-Sep 2026, real ticks, $2,000 per month (each month a fresh run), 0.01 lot,
; sums of monthly returns (reports/xauusd-straddle-2026-real-ticks):
;     M1: +239.0%, PF 2.02, max DD 2.7%, 9,985 trades, win rate 45%, avg win $2.12 / loss -$0.85
;         Jan +120.0, Feb +75.5, Mar +33.0, Apr +10.7, Jun -0.2; no trades in May, Jul-Oct
;     M5: +184.5%, PF 1.74, max DD 4.0%, 10,486 trades (Jan +109.7, Feb +27.7, Mar +45.5, Apr +1.5)
;   82% of the profit came from one event: the late-January crash and its aftermath. Outside it
;   the edge is small (cents per trade). In 2025 the $34 level was reached only in October.
;   Coin flip test passed: random-direction versions made +14% to +52% (see the README, Nyao Straddle).
; Requirements / warnings:
;   - Hedging account. Can share it with any Nyao Scalper profile, also on the same gold symbol
;     (own MagicNumber 25102501; it only touches its own orders and positions).
;   - Up to one position at a time; about $1 at risk per trade at 0.01 lot, more on fast-market
;     slippage (tester average about $0.10 per fill, real brokers can be worse).
;   - It may not trade for weeks: the chart status shows the H1 ATR next to the $34 it needs.
;   - Gold only: on USDJPY the spread is too large next to its moves (tested, lost every month).
; +-----------------------------------------+
; Volatility Filter
VolTimeframe=0
VolATRPeriod=7
VolBaseBars=288
VolMinRatio=2.0
VolMinATR=0.0
CancelWhenCalm=true
; Extreme Market Filter
RegimeTimeframe=16385
RegimeATRPeriod=14
RegimeMinATR=34.0
; Trading Sessions
EnableSessions=false
SessionUTCOffset=0
TradeAsia=true
AsiaStartUTC=0
AsiaEndUTC=9
TradeLondon=true
LondonStartUTC=7
LondonEndUTC=16
TradeNewYork=true
NewYorkStartUTC=12
NewYorkEndUTC=21
; Orders
Lots=0.01
RiskPercent=0.0
DistanceUnit=1
EntryDistance=1.0
StopLoss=1.0
TakeProfit=0.0
MaxSpread=0.0
PendingExpiryBars=0
; Trailing Stop
TrailStart=0.0
TrailDistance=1.0
TrailStep=0.1
BreakEvenTrigger=0.0
BreakEvenLock=0.2
; Losing Streak Pause
LossStreakPause=10
LossStreakPauseMinutes=30
; Other
EntryMode=0
CoinFlipSeed=1
MagicNumber=25102501
TesterEquityLog=true
